WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:02,800
Why change the route?

2
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:04,720
Don't ask so many questions, you two.

3
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:06,000
I'll study it later

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,040
How to share routes

5
00:00:07,320 --> 00:00:08,920
You must follow our car

6
00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:10,720
Be sure to keep your spirits high

7
00:00:10,960 --> 00:00:12,040
Let Susie and Fan Jiawen

8
00:00:12,040 --> 00:00:13,280
Don't get off the bus easily, they two

9
00:00:14,110 --> 00:00:16,270
Did you hear what Xiaoxiao said? Don’t get out of the car?

10
00:00:16,470 --> 00:00:17,590
It's more dangerous to be blocked now

11
00:00:18,270 --> 00:00:23,350
You might lose someone in the crowd. The windows are closed. Don't open. Sister, don't worry.

12
00:00:23,350 --> 00:00:25,670
Neither of us will get out of the car or open the window.

13
00:00:25,670 --> 00:00:27,350
The city is in chaos. The city is also going crazy.

14
00:00:27,830 --> 00:00:29,030
Fortunately, I listened to you, Sister Wang.

15
00:00:29,230 --> 00:00:30,230
Otherwise it would be really dangerous

16
00:00:30,590 --> 00:00:31,590
Thank you sister and brother Liu

17
00:00:32,110 --> 00:00:33,230
We will listen to you from now on

18
00:00:34,010 --> 00:00:35,410
Xiaoxiao, are you hungry?

19
00:00:35,650 --> 00:00:37,610
There are buns and snacks in the back row

20
00:00:37,610 --> 00:00:39,690
You're welcome to take whatever you want to eat.

21
00:00:39,850 --> 00:00:41,970
If you feel sleepy, take a nap. I'm not hungry.

22
00:00:42,450 --> 00:00:43,650
Sister, you don’t have to worry about me

23
00:00:47,220 --> 00:00:48,780
Not a three-year-old
